Subject: [PATCH] Preserve the invocation name of credential capture helpers

Keep executing the canonical, validated helper path, but preserve the
expanded configured command as argv[0]. Gentoo's python-exec multicall
wrapper needs the original invocation name to select the interpreter.
Apply the same handling to command and provider captures on Unix.

Exercise real captures through argv0-sensitive native shell symlinks,
including absolute paths, environment expansion, bare names and providers.

